# My First RPG

This is a personal project repo where i will attempt to build out some kind of rpg-style game.

I want the gameplay to center around exploration, resource gathering, crafting, survival, and ranking up.

I think i want to somehow implement some type of home base you can fortify to store your possesions. This will be something you will have to protect from other players (or AI). I also want the player to be able to go on raids.
